#: src/Admin/WithdrawalSettingsPage.php:236
msgid "Consent mode"
msgstr "Рэжым згоды"

#: src/Admin/WithdrawalSettingsPage.php:240
msgid "Required - block checkout unless the consumer ticks the consent box."
msgstr ""
"Патрэбна - блакуйце аформленне замовы, пакуль спажывец не пазначыць поле "
"згоды."

#: src/Admin/WithdrawalSettingsPage.php:241
msgid ""
"Optional - show an unchecked consent box. Only ticked orders become exempt."
